{"metadata": {"file_suffix": "pdf", "producer": {"name": "mineru", "version": "4.0.10"}, "document": {"page_count": 1, "page_count_kind": "physical"}}, "extensions": {"mineru": {"tier": "basic", "parse_mode": "txt"}, "docvortex_layout": {"version": 1, "pages": [{"page_idx": 0, "width_pt": 595.0, "height_pt": 842.0}]}}, "pages": [{"page_idx": 0, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.117, 0.089, 0.546, 0.112], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "离心泵运行与结构手册（合成样本）"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.122, 0.127, 0.256, 0.146], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1 安全须知"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.115, 0.155, 0.882, 0.195], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "检修前必须切断电源并在配电柜悬挂“禁止合闸”标识，确认泵体完全停转、机封冷却后方可拆卸。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.116, 0.208, 0.685, 0.225], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "运行中严禁靠近联轴器防护罩，禁止在泵体带压状态下拆卸法兰螺栓。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.12, 0.243, 0.257, 0.261], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2 结构原理"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.116, 0.271, 0.882, 0.313], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "离心泵由泵壳、叶轮、轴、机械密封与轴承箱等部件组成，电机通过联轴器驱动叶轮高速旋转。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.116, 0.323, 0.74, 0.34], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "叶轮旋转使液体获得动能，经蜗壳扩压后转化为压力能，从而实现液体输送。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.12, 0.357, 0.257, 0.376], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3 安装要求"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.116, 0.386, 0.881, 0.426], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "泵组基础应具有足够刚度，地脚螺栓逐个对角紧固，联轴器同轴度偏差不超过 0.05 m m。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.116, 0.438, 0.759, 0.456], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "吸入管路应尽量短且避免气囊，进口过滤器通流面积不小于吸入管截面的三倍。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.12, 0.473, 0.256, 0.492], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4 运行维护"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.116, 0.501, 0.815, 0.518], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "轴承温度正常不超过 70 摄氏度，振动烈度应控制在 4.5 m m/s 以内。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.116, 0.531, 0.87, 0.548], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "每运行 2000 小时更换一次润滑油，并检查机械密封泄漏量是否小于 5 滴每分钟。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.12, 0.566, 0.257, 0.584], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5 故障排查"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.116, 0.594, 0.796, 0.611], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "振动超标常见原因为转子不平衡、联轴器不对中或轴承磨损，应结合频谱分析定位。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.116, 0.623, 0.704, 0.64], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "流量不足多与叶轮磨损、进口堵塞或密封环间隙过大有关，需逐项排查。"}]}]}], "is_full_document": true, "schema": "docvortex.middle", "schema_version": "2.0"}